      "chunk_id": "SC_2021_THE_STATE_OF_RAJASTHAN_VS_SHIV_CHARAN_MEENA_P003_C01",
      "text": "No.1342 of 2017.\nThe post of Driver in the Agriculture Department of the State Government at",
