      "chunk_id": "SC_2021_THE_STATE_OF_RAJASTHAN_VS_SHIV_CHARAN_MEENA_P004_C01",
      "text": "regularized w.e.f. 16.10.2002 vide office order dated 08.01.2003. However, since said",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2021_THE_STATE_OF_RAJASTHAN_VS_SHIV_CHARAN_MEENA_P005_C01",
      "text": "engaged on contract basis through Jaipur Ex-Servicemen Welfare Cooperative Society",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 6,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2021_THE_STATE_OF_RAJASTHAN_VS_SHIV_CHARAN_MEENA_P006_C01",
      "text": "handover charge of the vehicle in question to said Lalu Ram Meena vide office order",
