      "chunk_id": "SC_2021_THE_STATE_OF_RAJASTHAN_VS_SHIV_CHARAN_MEENA_P007_C01",
      "text": "dated 05.05.2015.\nThis led to the filing of S.B. Civil Writ No.7637 of 2015 by the respondent",
