      "text": "Court vide judgment and order dated 09.05.2017 with costs in the sum of Rs.25,000/-.\nBeing aggrieved, the Department preferred D.B. Civil Special Appeal (Writ)",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
